<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>2.1.3 Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00374</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.1.3 Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>1f5cc0d5-95c1-421a-a38f-9a30af82693c</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para dir="ltr">An automotive store is shipping car parts to a mechanic.</para>
<list>
  <item>Each shock weighs 7 pounds.</item>
  <item>Each brake pad weighs 4 pounds.</item>
</list>
<para dir="ltr">The store shipped 20 parts weighing a total of 104 pounds. How many shocks, \(x\), and brake pads, \(y\), did the mechanic buy?</para></section>
</content>
</document>
